        "value": "0x0043C26C",
        "profile": "profile.ccz66.xinnai12.local.8ba1",
        "evidence": "static-verified"
      },
      "callingConvention": "栈参 (伤害, 特效值)，调用 0x425AD9",
      "inputs": "[ebp-4]=当前伤害；EAX=特效值",
      "returns": "EAX=伤害×特效值÷100；调用方把它加回 [ebp-4]",
      "semantics": "0x425AD9 为 (a*b)/100 的百分比乘法；0x43C275 执行 add [ebp-4], eax，所以 120 表示该段 +120%，不是把伤害变为 120%。",
