        "value": "0x0041DCE6",
        "profile": "profile.ccz66.xinnai12.local.8ba1",
        "evidence": "static-verified"
      },
      "callingConvention": "循环体内联",
      "inputs": "EAX=策略 ID",
      "returns": "标志",
      "semantics": "test byte [eax+0x4D14E0],1；0x465B66 为 AI 列表侧同一测试。该测试只在调用方模式≠0 时执行；模式=0 时不需要 bit0。另有 0x41832B（射程/目标合法性）、0x40DE69（策略可用性）与 MP 门禁。",
      "relations": [
